[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705108033","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103722#issuecomment-2705108033","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103722","id":2705108033,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hPKxB","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-06T22:45:21Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T23:06:02Z","body":"This is caused by mesh LOD merging vertices together and using smooth shading in the process (presumably for performance reasons).\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16194130-56c0-490b-bc0b-879c3d689f2d\n\nThis issue is not present in 4.3, most likely because it uses an older version of meshoptimizer with different optimization. If you disable **Meshes > Generate LOD** on the Import dock on the 3D scene in question, the issue will go away.\n\nNormal buffer comparison:\n\n4.3 | 4.4\n-|-\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67c656dc-dd76-48fb-ab72-0093b126bc3b) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/de52b1f6-4fc0-40ef-968d-f597b3806e8c)\n\n@HaroldH76 Can you try following the same steps on 4.4 dev/beta/RCs to determine when the regression started? You can download them [here](https://godotengine.org/download/archive/).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705108033/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707079126","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103722#issuecomment-2707079126","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103722","id":2707079126,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hWr_W","user":{"login":"HaroldH76","id":48763195,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NzYzMTk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48763195?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HaroldH76","html_url":"https://github.com/HaroldH76","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HaroldH76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HaroldH76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HaroldH76/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HaroldH76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HaroldH76/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HaroldH76/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HaroldH76/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HaroldH76/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HaroldH76/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T18:03:51Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T18:03:51Z","body":"@Calinou thx for the quick response!\n\nI tested other versions and:\nv4.4.dev4.official [36e6207bb] => Nok\nv4.4.dev3.official [f4af8201b] => Ok\n\nAlso disabling generating LODs on import settings fixed it for my game. \n\nThx again!\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707079126/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707108201","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103722#issuecomment-2707108201","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103722","id":2707108201,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hWzFp","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T18:20:22Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T19:11:42Z","body":"Thanks for the bisecting help 🙂 \nChangelog between 4.4.dev3 and 4.4.dev4: https://godotengine.github.io/godot-interactive-changelog/#4.4-dev4\n\nThis changelog includes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98529, so there's a fair chance it's related. I'll bisect this just to make sure.\n\n**Edit:** I bisected the regression to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98529. cc @zeux ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707108201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707239137","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103722#issuecomment-2707239137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103722","id":2707239137,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hXTDh","user":{"login":"zeux","id":1106629,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDY2Mjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1106629?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux","html_url":"https://github.com/zeux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T19:26:07Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T19:55:57Z","body":"The LOD generator in Godot has always (edit: well, since like 4.1? it's been a while) welded vertices with similar normals before simplification before passing it to the simplifier. So I'm surprised this ever worked on 4.3; maybe because the attribute metric was not working as well, the simplifier for some reason was hesitant to merge these specifically. I assume it's just a happenstance, for example maybe the edges of the object were locked and the object is so low-poly that all edge collapses were prevented before the update due to extra topological restrictions that were lifted. \n\nThis is controlled by the \"normal angle\" threshold in import settings. Setting that to 10 (from default 60) fixes this specific example.\n\nI'm not sure it's realistic to expect the simplifier to preserve the facets with the setting set to an angle that exceeds the angle between faceted triangles in a given model, because it's literally instructed to simplify from a welded model, and any collapse around the welded region will effectively change the shading. If faceting needs to be preserved exactly, the setting should be set to a very low value (which obviously limits simplification to only flat areas, but such is life...).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707239137/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707245049","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103722#issuecomment-2707245049","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103722","id":2707245049,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hXUf5","user":{"login":"zeux","id":1106629,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDY2Mjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1106629?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux","html_url":"https://github.com/zeux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T19:29:44Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T19:29:44Z","body":"The face normal angle here is about 15 degrees fwiw, so it makes sense that the threshold needs to be set to 10 degrees to work.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5f0e2f1f-3f53-4aa0-8c85-6e2ba7f31b86)\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707245049/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]